"The Watch is never asked to do anything — worn and paired, it already measures, and the readings wait in this phone's health store. A reading, not a live feed: samples arrive at the Watch's sync cadence, and every value carries its age. Read-only and on-device; raw readings are never written to the night log." = "Часы никогда ни о чём не просят — надетые и сопряжённые, они уже измеряют, а показания ждут в HealthKit.";
